  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/ironjetpacks?source=modrinth\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cucumber\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\" align=\"left\"><a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/iron-jetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/iron-jetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/iron-jetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/docs/ironjetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=文档&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/wiki/ironjetpacks\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=百科&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Iron Jetpacks 是一款功能丰富且易于使用的现代化喷气背包模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>特色功能</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">完全可定制！所有喷气背包属性和参数均可配置，还能添加自定义配置！<a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/docs/ironjetpacks/jetpack-json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(文档)</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">内置多款默认喷气背包，采用原版及模组材料打造。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用Forge能源系统(FE)供能，兼容性广泛。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">油门控制系统！实时调节空中飞行速度！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">通过内置HUD实时查看能量、引擎、悬停及油门状态。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>新增！</strong>支持Curios！可将喷气背包装备为饰品。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/blakesmods\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fdf1b29a-987b-450e-b6d4-a16c2da8aadf.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></span></p>",
